<section class="border-b border-base-300 bg-base-100 py-14 sm:py-16">
  <div class="container-anatomia">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">Safety</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Safety & disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70 sm:text-base">
        AnatomiaX is designed to support learning. Understanding its limits is part of using it
        responsibly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-base-200 py-12 sm:py-16">
  <div class="container-anatomia">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6">
        <h2 id="educational-use" class="text-lg font-semibold">Educational use only</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">
          All content — 3D anatomy, lessons, simulations, cases, and AI responses — is provided for
          education. It is not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.
          Always seek the advice of a qualified health professional with any questions regarding a
          medical condition.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6">
        <h2 id="no-diagnosis" class="text-lg font-semibold">No medical diagnosis</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">
          AnatomiaX does not analyze personal symptoms, images, or laboratory results. AI features
          are retrieval-augmented and safety-filtered to stay within educational bounds. Do not rely
          on the platform for emergency care. If you need urgent help, contact local emergency
          services or your healthcare provider immediately.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-warning/20 bg-warning/10 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold">Sources and verification</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">
          Medical content is curated from trusted references listed in our
          <code class="rounded bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">medical-data/sources</code> library
          and validated before publication. If you notice a potential inaccuracy, please
          <a href="/contact/" class="link link-primary">contact us</a> so we can review it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Questions?</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/60">
          For support or to report a concern, visit <a href="/contact/" class="link link-primary">Contact</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
